<title>USA: N.Y. cert cotton stocks fall 480 bales to 91,526.</title>
<headline>N.Y. cert cotton stocks fall 480 bales to 91,526.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Certificated cotton stocks deliverable against New York Cotton Exchange's No. 2 cotton futures contract as of Aug 13 totaled 91,526 bales, down from 92,006 bales the previous session.</p>
<p>There were no bales issued, no bales awaiting review, no decertification orders, and 480 cancellations. ((New York Commodity Desk, 212-859-1640))</p>
</text>
